---
import ProjectLayout from "../../layouts/ProjectLayout.astro";
---
<ProjectLayout title="Gastro: Identidad de Marca">

  <div class="project-header">
    <div class="project-header-left">
      <h1 class="project-title" data-i18n="project.gastro-brand.title">Gastro: Identidad de Marca</h1>
      <p class="project-tagline" data-i18n="project.gastro-brand.tagline"></p>
    </div>
    <div class="project-header-right">
      <div class="project-meta-grid">
        <div class="meta-item">
          <div class="meta-label" data-i18n="meta.category">Categoría</div>
          <div class="meta-value" data-i18n="project.gastro-brand.category">Branding</div>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-item">
          <div class="meta-label" data-i18n="meta.year">Año</div>
          <div class="meta-value">2026</div>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-item">
          <div class="meta-label" data-i18n="meta.client">Cliente</div>
          <div class="meta-value">Gastro</div>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-item">
          <div class="meta-label" data-i18n="meta.services">Servicios</div>
          <div class="meta-value" data-i18n="project.gastro-brand.services">Brand &amp; Identity · Art Direction</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="project-hero">
    <video src="/images/gastro-brand/hero.mp4" autoplay muted loop playsinline></video>
  </div>

  <!-- 1: Contexto y Desafío -->
  <div class="content-section" data-reveal>
    <div class="content-text">
      <div>
        <p class="content-eyebrow" data-i18n="about.project">Sobre el Proyecto</p>
        <h2 class="content-heading" data-i18n="project.gastro-brand.s1.heading">Contexto y Desafío</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="content-body">
        <p data-i18n="project.gastro-brand.s1.body">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Vestibulum at libero nec nulla elementum fringilla. Cras vehicula felis at dignissim volutpat, integer ac velit nec arcu commodo vulputate. Proin tincidunt nisl sed libero faucibus, a dapibus enim interdum nec.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>


  <div class="content-section">
    <div class="img-grid-2">
      <img src="/images/gastro-brand/01.webp" alt="" data-reveal>
      <img src="/images/gastro-brand/02.webp" alt="" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:80ms">
    </div>
  </div>


  <!-- 2: Estrategia de Marca -->
  <div class="content-section" data-reveal>
    <div class="content-text">
      <div>
        <p class="content-eyebrow" data-i18n="section.strategy">Estrategia</p>
        <h2 class="content-heading" data-i18n="project.gastro-brand.s2.heading">Posicionamiento de Marca</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="content-body">
        <p data-i18n="project.gastro-brand.s2.body">Sed ut perspiciatis unde omnis iste natus error sit voluptatem accusantium doloremque laudantium, totam rem aperiam eaque ipsa quae ab illo inventore veritatis et quasi architecto beatae vitae dicta sunt explicabo nemo enim ipsam.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>


  <div class="content-section">
    <div class="img-padded">
      <img src="/images/gastro-brand/wide-01.webp" alt="" data-reveal>
    </div>
  </div>


  <div class="content-section">
    <div class="img-grid-3">
      <img src="/images/gastro-brand/01v.webp" alt="" data-reveal>
      <img src="/images/gastro-brand/02v.webp" alt="" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:80ms">
      <img src="/images/gastro-brand/03v.webp" alt="" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:160ms">
    </div>
  </div>


  <!-- 3: Sistema Visual -->
  <div class="content-section" data-reveal>
    <div class="content-text">
      <div>
        <p class="content-eyebrow" data-i18n="section.identity">Identidad Final</p>
        <h2 class="content-heading" data-i18n="project.gastro-brand.s3.heading">Sistema Visual</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="content-body">
        <p data-i18n="project.gastro-brand.s3.body">At vero eos et accusamus et iusto odio dignissimos ducimus qui blanditiis praesentium voluptatum deleniti atque corrupti quos dolores et quas molestias excepturi sint occaecati cupiditate non provident similique sunt in culpa officia deserunt.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>


  <a class="next-project" id="next-link" href="/">
    <p class="next-label" data-i18n="next.project">Siguiente proyecto</p>
    <h2 class="next-title" id="next-title">—</h2>
    <span class="next-arrow">→</span>
  </a>

<script is:inline>
  (function () {
    const ring = document.getElementById('cursorRing');;
    const next = document.getElementById('next-link');
    let mx=0,my=0,cx=0,cy=0;
    document.addEventListener('mousemove', e => { mx=e.clientX; my=e.clientY; });
    (function loop(){ cx+=(mx-cx)*0.14; cy+=(my-cy)*0.14; ring.style.left=cx+'px'; ring.style.top=cy+'px'; requestAnimationFrame(loop); })();
    next.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => ring.classList.add('is-active'));
    next.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => ring.classList.remove('is-active'));
  })();
  (function () {
    const visible = PROJECTS.filter(function(p){ return !p.hidden; });
    const idx = visible.findIndex(function(p){ return p.id === 'gastro-brand'; });
    const next = visible[(idx + 1) % visible.length];
    const t    = window.TRANSLATIONS || {};
    document.getElementById('next-title').textContent = t['project.' + next.id + '.title'] || next.id;
    document.getElementById('next-link').href = next.url;
  })();
  </script>
</ProjectLayout>
